                                                "sense_id": "eae75add-3559-3384-a819-399fb17add46",
                                                "text": "The first sign of cellular abnormality in some tumors is an epimutation—a change in heritable chromatin marks, such as an increase or decrease in the density of DNA methylation."
                                            }
